1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:02,391
(Howard:)Just flip the switch

2
00:00:02,396 --> 00:00:05,496
(Howard:)until the lights on the drone
change to solid yellow.

3
00:00:05,499 --> 00:00:07,699
(Sheldon:)All right,
that seems simple enough.

4
00:00:07,702 --> 00:00:10,772
(Sheldon:)Initiating calibration sequence.

5
00:00:10,771 --> 00:00:12,741
(Sheldon:)One, two, three, four,

6
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:16,510
(Sheldon:)five, six, seven,
eight, nine, ten.

7
00:00:19,112 --> 00:00:22,482
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose ten
is technically "at least ten."

8
00:00:24,517 --> 00:00:27,187
(Sheldon:)But they're still getting
at least one angry letter.

9
00:00:29,589 --> 00:00:32,029
(Howard:)Now I rotate
it horizontally

10
00:00:32,026 --> 00:00:35,966
on its center axis until
the lights turn green.

11
00:00:35,963 --> 00:00:38,033
(Sheldon:)Initiating rotation sequence.

12
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,000
(Sheldon:)Don't look at me, initiate.

13
00:00:46,239 --> 00:00:47,909
(Raj:)Oh...
What does red
and yellow mean?

14
00:00:47,908 --> 00:00:49,408
(Howard:)It means the
calibration failed.

15
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:50,910
(Howard:)We have to start over.

16
00:00:50,911 --> 00:00:51,941
(Sheldon:)Oh. Very well.

17
00:00:51,946 --> 00:00:54,746
(Sheldon:)Reinitiating
calibration sequence.

18
00:00:54,749 --> 00:00:56,649
(Sheldon:)One, two, three, four,

19
00:00:56,651 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)five, six,
seven, eight, nine, ten...

